Wearing a helm of opposite alignment only changes your alignment
temporarily. Simply get rid of it (the succubus already helped you with
that) and you're back to normal. No problem with the quest either.

The loss of protection is not due to your god being angry, it's just a
side effect of wearing the helm. Unless you do something terribly
stupid to anger your original god while wearing the helmet, he won't
care. That's why it's still safe to pray.

You might want to have a look at the mini-spoiler on the helmet for
further information:
http://www.nethack.de/spoiler/hooa_questions.txt

Oh, about that wand telling you you're still protected, I don't think
it's a bug. IIRC you are "protected" from the moment you first receive
divine protection. Losing the actual AC later, whatever the reason,
won't change that. You're still "protected", only the effect is gone.
I might be wrong on this, though. 

